# Names only, never values. Copy this file to .env and fill it in. .env is never committed.
# Needed for the live demo: the model behind all agents (Claude, console.anthropic.com).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Needed for the live demo: the web search (tavily.com). Asked only for a query that is not saved in data/cache/tavily.
TAVILY_API_KEY=
# Optional: Google Places (rating, opening hours, entrance flag) for the scout over MCP. Enable "Places API (New)" for the key's project in the Google Cloud console; the project needs billing. Without it nothing changes.
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=
# Optional: another model id for all agents. The default is set in gilmate/agent.py.
# GILMATE_MODEL=
# Optional: street photos from Mapillary (graph.mapillary.com). Without it the saved ones are used, then KartaView.
# MAPILLARY_TOKEN=
# Optional switch, not a key: set it to "off" to leave out the weather and air quality of the day (Open-Meteo, no key).
# GILMATE_WEATHER=
# Optional switch, not a key: set it to "on" to add the climb on each walk. Off by default: the heights were too rough in Shibuya.
# GILMATE_CLIMB=
